+ * 1616-1984), L2C (1.3-rfa 1200-1352), L10C (3.3-ch0 3200-3312) as
+ * {voltage@0, mode@8 (HPM 7), enable@4}; rfclka2 enable@4; and the modem
+ * proxy votes on cx.lvl/mss.lvl (one table index at offset 0). Everything
+ * else, including Sweet's touch supply L11C, is refused.
