+/*
+ * 0149: a bus (BCM) vote from the kernel. The apps SMMU (0x15000000) sits
+ * behind the path its downstream node votes (msm-bus 161 -> 627 = BCMs SN15
+ * and CN0, active-only, 1000 KBps); 0131's wland stalled a CPU on its first
+ * apps-SMMU read with no such vote. Command: commit|valid|x<<14|y, as
+ * Linux's BCM_TCS_CMD. Only those two BCMs, only small nonzero levels.
+ */
